@startuml
title Trinh tu dang nhap
autonumber
actor "Nguoi dung" as User
participant "Web React" as Web
participant "Firebase Auth" as Auth
participant "Backend Express" as API
database "MongoDB" as DB
User -> Web: Nhap email va mat khau
Web -> Auth: Dang nhap email/mat khau
alt Thong tin khong hop le
 Auth --> Web: Loi xac thuc
 Web --> User: Hien thi loi
else Xac thuc thanh cong
 Auth --> Web: Firebase ID token
 Web -> API: POST /api/v1/users/me/sync
 API -> Auth: Xac minh ID token (Firebase Admin)
 Auth --> API: UID da xac minh
 API -> DB: Tim hoac tao/cap nhat user theo firebase_uid
 DB --> API: Ho so va role
 API --> Web: JSON ho so
 Web --> User: Hien thi trang chu
end
@enduml
